<title>USA: Cambridge-Isanti ISD 911, Minn., won by Cronin.</title>
<headline>Cambridge-Isanti ISD 911, Minn., won by Cronin.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co. said it won $18.720 million of Cambridge-Isanti ISD 911, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.24 percent.</p>
</text>
